    "doc_text": "XIN_ENG_20051125.0039\n\nBEIJING, Nov. 25 , 2005 (Xinhua)\n\nShanghai stock index mixed -- Nov. 25\n\n\n\n\nThe Composite Stock Index on the Shanghai Stock Exchange closed at 1,114.92 points on Friday, up 1.54 points from the previous close.\n\nA Share Index: 1,172.00 points, up 1.73 points;\n\nB Share Index: 61.53 points, down 0.48 points;\n\nTotal Turnover: 10,753,010,000 yuan.",
